name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"NXwwmUQAY5yDofbs_Epq5A","review_id":"BpmBqr3Cbf0UQHyHtHM9hw","date":"2021-05-12T03:09:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9382522106170654,"text_excerpt":"This was my introduction to Colombian cuisine and goodness I am glad I tried it. The restaurant is fairly new and very clean with interesting decorations and bright, inviting colors. Our server was absolutely delightful and very prompt. We started with a couple of juices-a passion fruit and guanabana. Wow! Refreshing. My friend had an empanada as an appetizer and we split the chicharróns-best I've ever had. There was an avocado sauce and a pink sauce served with both that were tasty and house made. My friend had a chicken soup served with rice, avocado, sour cream, and capers on the side. It was beautiful and he said it reminded him of the same exact type of soup that he had in Bogotá. I ..."},{"business_id":"NXwwmUQAY5yDofbs_Epq5A","review_id":"LONmPg5zv60EheTS5FT0xg","date":"2020-08-05T21:46:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9180541038513184,"text_excerpt":"This cute restaurant had all of my Colombian favorites. Located off the beaten path but worth it. I ordered a few items for take-out and didn't wait long. Everything was packaged neatly and still hot when I came home to eat. Everything was absolutely delicious and it was authentic Colombian cuisine. All the staff were wearing face masks and were very nice and attentive. I'll be back!"},{"business_id":"NXwwmUQAY5yDofbs_Epq5A","review_id":"djl-Tjtfu3R4c9M8L6D8VA","date":"2021-08-23T16:25:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9004809856414795,"text_excerpt":"The food here is a reflection on what you would find in any Colombian kitchen; the servings are large and the dishes don't hold back on the flavor. The experience feels as if you are eating in a friend's home rather than a restaurant. Some of the menu's specialties are Empandas ($2.50), a traditional corn patty filled with beef or chicken; Bandeja Paisa ($22), white rice, red beans, grilled steak, pork belly fried egg, avocado, sweet plantain, Colombian chorizo and arepa; Patacón Gloria ($18-$22), fried green plantain with lettuce and cheese with choice of pork, steak and chicken, or shrimp; and Pescado Frito ($25), a grilled stuffed fish served with rice, vegetables, fried green plantain..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"NXwwmUQAY5yDofbs_Epq5A","photo_id":"TIUS-WFeTtl3W-jSW6dO4Q","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/TIUS-WFeTtl3W-jSW6dO4Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8281351327896118},{"business_id":"NXwwmUQAY5yDofbs_Epq5A","photo_id":"adoUBHp5vLPVMmLkAc_LMQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/adoUBHp5vLPVMmLkAc_LMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.807774007320404},{"business_id":"NXwwmUQAY5yDofbs_Epq5A","photo_id":"NsszbSYB0tkNKWGDRb5CqA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NsszbSYB0tkNKWGDRb5CqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8002539873123169},{"business_id":"NXwwmUQAY5yDofbs_Epq5A","photo_id":"ftcXAobKo4iDtadqYoNioQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ftcXAobKo4iDtadqYoNioQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7988278269767761},{"business_id":"NXwwmUQAY5yDofbs_Epq5A","photo_id":"pf2YlhLihRLzup6ahU3LHg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pf2YlhLihRLzup6ahU3LHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7140030860900879}]},"notebook_case":null}
